Website for my college extension project. My proposal is to create an educational website to raise awareness about the wildlife of the Tibagi River.

EcoMap ODS is an extension project developed as part of the academic activities of the Systems Analysis and Development course.
Its main goal is to promote environmental education and sustainability awareness through technology.

The system is an interactive website that allows users to explore information about the fauna and flora of a specific region, highlighting native and invasive species, while providing maps, guidance, and QR Codes for on-site information access.

Based on the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), EcoMap aims to combine technological innovation and environmental preservation, making learning about nature more accessible and engaging.

Key features:

🐾 Native and invasive fauna/flora identification

📱 Integration with informational QR Codes

🧭 Ecological navigation and safety guide

💡 Educational content on sustainability
